sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente / Postman
    participant G as Gateway nginx<br/>:8000
    participant S as catalog-service<br/>Laravel :8000
    participant R as Redis<br/>blacklist JWT
    participant D as PostgreSQL<br/>catalog_db

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        Note over C,D: Escenario A — GET detalle de cine (JWT)
        C->>G: GET /api/catalog/cinemas/1<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
        G->>S: GET /api/cinemas/1 (strip /api/catalog)
        S->>S: jwt.verify: decodifica JWT<br/>¿jti en blacklist?
        S->>R: consultar blacklist
        R-->>S: no revocado
        S->>S: ctype_digit(1) → find(1)<br/>movies + showtimes (pivote + auditorium)
        S-->>G: 200 {code:200, message, data:{cinema, movies, showtimes}}
        G-->>C: 200 {code:200, message, data:{...}}
    end

    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        Note over C,D: Escenario B — POST crear cine (JWT + admin)
        C->>G: POST /api/catalog/cinemas<br/>Bearer JWT admin + JSON
        G->>S: POST /api/cinemas
        S->>S: jwt.verify → role:admin (¿rol admin?)
        S->>S: StoreCinemaRequest valida<br/>name, address, city
        alt campos inválidos
            S-->>C: 422 {code:500, message:"Errores de validación", errors:{...}}
        else válido
            S->>D: INSERT INTO cinemas<br/>(created_by=updated_by=sub JWT)
            D-->>S: id=3
            S-->>C: 201 {code:200, message:"Cine creado correctamente", data:{id:3}}
        end
    end

    rect rgb(254, 243, 199)
        Note over C,D: Escenario C — POST sync de cartelera (JWT + admin)
        C->>G: POST /api/catalog/cinemas/1/movies<br/>{"movie_ids":[uuid1, uuid2]}
        G->>S: POST /api/cinemas/1/movies
        S->>S: role:admin → SyncCinemaMoviesRequest<br/>(array de UUIDs existentes)
        S->>D: DELETE + INSERT movie_cinema<br/>(sync = reemplaza cartelera)
        D-->>S: OK
        S-->>C: 200 {code:200, message, data:[peliculas ordenadas]}
    end

    rect rgb(254, 242, 242)
        Note over C,D: Escenarios de error
        C->>G: cualquier request sin/vencido JWT
        S-->>C: 401 {code:500, message:"Token..."}
        Note over C,D: DELETE cine con salas o funciones
        C->>G: DELETE /api/catalog/cinemas/1
        S->>D: ¿auditoriums o showtimes?
        D-->>S: sí
        S-->>C: 409 "No se puede eliminar: el cine tiene salas o funciones asociadas"
    end
